<title>USA: Pacifice Enterprises shareholders ok deal.</title>
<headline>Pacifice Enterprises shareholders ok deal.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Enterprises and Enova Corp shareholders approved the merger of the two companies at separate meetings held in Los Angeles and Del Mar, Calif, respectively, both companies said.</p>
<p>The shareholder approval represents another milestone in the merger process for the two companies, which will create a new California-based Fortune 500 energy-services corporation with a total market value of $5.2 billion.</p>
</text>
